    {
      "id": "l1",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "What is a money market fund",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "What is a money market fund"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/1-czym-jest-fundusz-rynku-pien.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **money market fund** invests in very short and safe instruments, e.g. **treasury bills** and short bank deposits."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It grows **slowly but steadily**, and its return is close to the central bank's rates."
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "It's not a deposit – **there's no deposit guarantee**, but the risk of a drop is very small."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Deposit vs money market fund",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Deposit vs money market fund"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-lokata-vs-fundusz.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Deposit** – guaranteed interest and protection up to 100,000 €, but your money is **locked**",
                "**Fund** – no guarantee and a small annual fee (TER), but you can sell it **at any time** without losing interest"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "A deposit is **certainty**, a fund is **flexibility**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "When it makes sense",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "When it makes sense"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/3-kiedy-to-ma-sens.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It works when you may need the money **at any moment**, but you don't want it sitting at 0%. For example:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Emergency fund**",
                "**Cash waiting** to be invested",
                "Money for **a purchase in a few months**"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You get a return **close to market rates** and your money isn't locked like in a deposit."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": []
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
